oped a comprehensive multi-vendor laundry management platform using PHP/Laravel and MySQL with multi-role Flutter mobile applications for Customers, Store Owners, and Delivery Riders. Engineered 80+ RESTful API endpoints, real-time order state tracking, Moyasar payment gateway, and centralized administration dashboard.</p>\n<p>• <strong>Customer App</strong>: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fastlaundry.customerapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Google Play</a> | <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6743033070\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">App Store</a>\n• <strong>Store &#x26; Admin App</strong>: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fastlaundry.storeapps\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Google Play</a> | <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6743033906\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">App Store</a>\n• <strong>Delivery Captain App</strong>: <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.fastlaundry.deliveryapp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Google Play</a> | <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/id6743049120\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">App Store</a></p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Zeem – Ride-Sharing Platform","cover":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","backgroundColor":"#284898","images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/89093/zeem.png","srcSet":"/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/a15a6/zeem.png 175w,\n/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/8e4a7/zeem.png 350w,\n/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/89093/zeem.png 700w,\n/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/82960/zeem.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/96e31/zeem.avif 175w,\n/static/2b91726a563c7fe59c5f63a567b14af9/c7b75/zeem.avif 350w,\n/stat